    {
      "evidence_id": "official-3cf78932de40a878c420429132c0b05a",
      "source_url": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-announces-financial-results-for-second-quarter-fiscal-2027",
      "published_at": null,
      "available_at": "2026-08-27T04:00:00Z",
      "retrieval": {
        "document_id": "9bc4950664f1773de163da3dd9058b9373a2a553b8e772949ad5899a0c0436dc",
        "content_hash": "282f517583f249b35d4e497b64c8370439b42034e31fc0f31481753740e73c70",
        "source_query": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news?q=earnings",
        "source_type": "company_ir",
        "authority": "official",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-09-15T17:58:10.019804Z",
        "publication_date": "2026-08-26",
        "publication_precision": "date",
        "available_at": "2026-08-27T04:00:00Z",
        "content_locator": "已讀 HTML 全文後節選；字元區間：0:6000,8397:11914,18532:22039,24103:27610",
        "excerpt": "NVIDIA’s outlook for the third quarter of fiscal 2027 is as follows:\nRevenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%. NVIDIA is not assuming any Data Center compute revenue from China in its outlook.\nGAAP and non-GAAP gross margins are expected to be 74.0%, plus or minus 50 basis points.\nGAAP and non-GAAP operating expenses are expected to be approximately $9.2 billion and $9.0 billion, respectively.",
        "claim_kind": "company_guidance",
        "source_status": "current"
      },
      "symbols": [
        "NVDA"
      ],
      "summary": "文件提供第三季度展望：預期營收為 1080 億美元（±2%）；並表示展望中不假設中國資料中心 compute revenue；GAAP 與 non-GAAP 毛利率預期為 74.0%（±50 bps）；GAAP 與 non-GAAP 營業費用約 92 億與 90 億美元。",
      "market_relevance": "公司對下一季營收區間、毛利率與費用的假設，對市場評估成長節奏與獲利率可預期性具有指標意義；其中「不假設中國資料中心 compute」亦是需要納入解讀的前提。",
      "interpretation": "untrusted_observation"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "official-5050f4879c6ecaba497aaa21c4b9645d",
      "source_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/monetary20260729a.htm",
      "published_at": "2026-07-29T18:00:00Z",
      "available_at": "2026-07-29T18:00:15Z",
      "retrieval": {
        "document_id": "e290aabba3caad80496847cfb5424b874694a37d342708327f2fa9dac0b163e6",
        "content_hash": "c9633bddfb6dbd8821e2145b601fdebb9397387c36f68161facb8de786363086",
        "source_query": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/feeds/press_monetary.xml",
        "source_type": "macro_release",
        "authority": "official",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-09-15T17:58:14.328012Z",
        "publication_date": "2026-07-29",
        "publication_precision": "datetime",
        "available_at": "2026-07-29T18:00:15Z",
        "content_locator": "已讀 HTML 全文；換行分隔文字節點",
        "excerpt": "Economic activity is expanding at a solid pace despite elevated uncertainty that owes, in part, to the conflict in the Middle East. Productivity growth and capital investment are strong. Job gains have kept pace with the workforce, and the unemployment rate has changed little.\nInflation remains elevated relative to the Committee's 2 percent goal, in part reflecting supply shocks that have driven price increases in certain sectors, including energy. The Committee will deliver price stability.",
        "claim_kind": "fact",
        "source_status": "revised"
      },
      "symbols": [
        "AVGO",
        "CASH",
        "GLD",
        "META",
        "NVDA",
        "PLTR"
      ],
      "summary": "文件表示：經濟活動以穩健速度擴張，但不確定性仍高，部分源於中東衝突；生產率成長與資本投資強；就業成長與勞動供給相符、失業率變化不大；通膨相對 2% 目標仍偏高，部分反映能源等部門的供給衝擊。",
      "market_relevance": "對成長、就業與通膨的現狀評估會影響政策路徑預期，進而影響利率與風險資產定價。",
      "interpretation": "untrusted_observation"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "official-7bb4df401e191fdf36bb54bf09883f21",
      "source_url": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-announces-financial-results-for-second-quarter-fiscal-2027",
      "published_at": null,
      "available_at": "2026-08-27T04:00:00Z",
      "retrieval": {
        "document_id": "9bc4950664f1773de163da3dd9058b9373a2a553b8e772949ad5899a0c0436dc",
        "content_hash": "282f517583f249b35d4e497b64c8370439b42034e31fc0f31481753740e73c70",
        "source_query": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news?q=earnings",
        "source_type": "company_ir",
        "authority": "official",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-09-15T17:58:10.019804Z",
        "publication_date": "2026-08-26",
        "publication_precision": "date",
        "available_at": "2026-08-27T04:00:00Z",
        "content_locator": "已讀 HTML 全文後節選；字元區間：0:6000,8397:11914,18532:22039,24103:27610",
        "excerpt": "NVIDIA (NASDAQ: NVDA) today reported revenue for the second quarter ended July 26, 2026, of $96.2 billion, up 18% from the previous quarter and up 106% from a year ago. For the quarter, GAAP and non-GAAP gross margins were both 75.0%. GAAP and non-GAAP earnings per diluted share were $2.46 and $2.22, respectively.",
        "claim_kind": "fact",
        "source_status": "current"
      },
      "symbols": [
        "NVDA"
      ],
      "summary": "文件指出：NVIDIA 第二季度（截至 2026/7/26）營收為 960.2 億美元、較前季成長 18%、較去年成長 106%；GAAP 與 non-GAAP 毛利率皆為 75.0%；GAAP 與 non-GAAP 稀釋每股盈餘分別為 2.46 與 2.22。",
      "market_relevance": "營收、毛利率與稀釋 EPS 等條目可作為判斷公司當季獲利能力與需求/定價狀況的直接依據。",
      "interpretation": "untrusted_observation"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "official-abc15c67ddb4d96ca517f920a12cac30",
      "source_url": "https://investors.broadcom.com/news-releases/news-release-details/broadcom-inc-announces-third-quarter-fiscal-year-2026-financial",
