        "publication_precision": "datetime",
        "available_at": "2026-09-15T06:31:14Z",
        "content_locator": "已讀 HTML 全文後節選；字元區間：0:6000,8017:11534",
        "excerpt": "Fourth quarter fiscal year 2026 revenue guidance of approximately\n$34.8 billion\n, an increase of 93 percent from the prior year period\nFourth quarter fiscal year 2026 Non-GAAP operating income guidance of approximately 66 percent of projected revenue",
        "claim_kind": "company_guidance",
        "source_status": "revised"
      },
      "symbols": [
        "AVGO"
      ],
      "summary": "文件提供第四季度展望：預期營收約 348 億美元；non-GAAP 營業利益指引約為「預期營收的 66%」。",
      "market_relevance": "公司下一季營收與 non-GAAP 營業利益率指引是市場用來評估成長與獲利走勢的參考依據；但實際結果可能與指引有差異。",
